=== Module 27 - LL(1) Error Recovery: Panic Mode & Phrase-Level ===

terminal mismatch on top   -> phrase-level: insert the expected token, keep the input.
M[A][t] blank/conflicted   -> panic mode:
    t in FOLLOW(A) (or $)   -> pop A (skip the nonterminal)
    otherwise              -> discard t, retry
one run, every error. every branch pops the stack or advances the input -> it stops.

grammar:
  E -> T Ep
  Ep -> + T Ep
  Ep -> epsilon
  T -> F Tp
  Tp -> * F Tp
  Tp -> epsilon
  F -> ( E )
  F -> id
  F -> num

synchronizing sets (= FOLLOW):
  FOLLOW(E) = { ), $ }
  FOLLOW(Ep) = { ), $ }
  FOLLOW(T) = { ), +, $ }
  FOLLOW(Tp) = { ), +, $ }
  FOLLOW(F) = { ), *, +, $ }

--- id + id * id ---
   0  top E     look id    expand E -> T Ep
   1  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   2  top F     look id    expand F -> id
   3  top id    look id    match
   4  top Tp    look +     expand Tp -> epsilon
   5  top Ep    look +     expand Ep -> + T Ep
   6  top +     look +     match
   7  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   8  top F     look id    expand F -> id
   9  top id    look id    match
  10  top Tp    look *     expand Tp -> * F Tp
  11  top *     look *     match
  12  top F     look id    expand F -> id
  13  top id    look id    match
  14  top Tp    look $     expand Tp -> epsilon
  15  top Ep    look $     expand Ep -> epsilon
  16  top $     look $     ACCEPT
  RESULT: accepted, no errors

--- id + * id ---
   0  top E     look id    expand E -> T Ep
   1  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   2  top F     look id    expand F -> id
   3  top id    look id    match
   4  top Tp    look +     expand Tp -> epsilon
   5  top Ep    look +     expand Ep -> + T Ep
   6  top +     look +     match
   7  top T     look *     discard '*'
   8  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   9  top F     look id    expand F -> id
  10  top id    look id    match
  11  top Tp    look $     expand Tp -> epsilon
  12  top Ep    look $     expand Ep -> epsilon
  13  top $     look $     ACCEPT
  RESULT: 1 error(s), recovered to end of input:
    @2  no rule for T on '*'; discarding '*'

--- id id + id ---
   0  top E     look id    expand E -> T Ep
   1  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   2  top F     look id    expand F -> id
   3  top id    look id    match
   4  top Tp    look id    discard 'id'
   5  top Tp    look +     expand Tp -> epsilon
   6  top Ep    look +     expand Ep -> + T Ep
   7  top +     look +     match
   8  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   9  top F     look id    expand F -> id
  10  top id    look id    match
  11  top Tp    look $     expand Tp -> epsilon
  12  top Ep    look $     expand Ep -> epsilon
  13  top $     look $     ACCEPT
  RESULT: 1 error(s), recovered to end of input:
    @1  no rule for Tp on 'id'; discarding 'id'

--- ( id + ) ---
   0  top E     look (     expand E -> T Ep
   1  top T     look (     expand T -> F Tp
   2  top F     look (     expand F -> ( E )
   3  top (     look (     match
   4  top E     look id    expand E -> T Ep
   5  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   6  top F     look id    expand F -> id
   7  top id    look id    match
   8  top Tp    look +     expand Tp -> epsilon
   9  top Ep    look +     expand Ep -> + T Ep
  10  top +     look +     match
  11  top T     look )     pop T (sync on FOLLOW)
  12  top Ep    look )     expand Ep -> epsilon
  13  top )     look )     match
  14  top Tp    look $     expand Tp -> epsilon
  15  top Ep    look $     expand Ep -> epsilon
  16  top $     look $     ACCEPT
  RESULT: 1 error(s), recovered to end of input:
    @3  no rule for T on ')'; skipping T (lookahead in FOLLOW)

--- + id ---
   0  top E     look +     discard '+'
   1  top E     look id    expand E -> T Ep
   2  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   3  top F     look id    expand F -> id
   4  top id    look id    match
   5  top Tp    look $     expand Tp -> epsilon
   6  top Ep    look $     expand Ep -> epsilon
   7  top $     look $     ACCEPT
  RESULT: 1 error(s), recovered to end of input:
    @0  no rule for E on '+'; discarding '+'

--- id * * num + id ---
   0  top E     look id    expand E -> T Ep
   1  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   2  top F     look id    expand F -> id
   3  top id    look id    match
   4  top Tp    look *     expand Tp -> * F Tp
   5  top *     look *     match
   6  top F     look *     pop F (sync on FOLLOW)
   7  top Tp    look *     expand Tp -> * F Tp
   8  top *     look *     match
   9  top F     look num   expand F -> num
  10  top num   look num   match
  11  top Tp    look +     expand Tp -> epsilon
  12  top Ep    look +     expand Ep -> + T Ep
  13  top +     look +     match
  14  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
  15  top F     look id    expand F -> id
  16  top id    look id    match
  17  top Tp    look $     expand Tp -> epsilon
  18  top Ep    look $     expand Ep -> epsilon
  19  top $     look $     ACCEPT
  RESULT: 1 error(s), recovered to end of input:
    @2  no rule for F on '*'; skipping F (lookahead in FOLLOW)

--- ( id + id ---
   0  top E     look (     expand E -> T Ep
   1  top T     look (     expand T -> F Tp
   2  top F     look (     expand F -> ( E )
   3  top (     look (     match
   4  top E     look id    expand E -> T Ep
   5  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
   6  top F     look id    expand F -> id
   7  top id    look id    match
   8  top Tp    look +     expand Tp -> epsilon
   9  top Ep    look +     expand Ep -> + T Ep
  10  top +     look +     match
  11  top T     look id    expand T -> F Tp
  12  top F     look id    expand F -> id
  13  top id    look id    match
  14  top Tp    look $     expand Tp -> epsilon
  15  top Ep    look $     expand Ep -> epsilon
  16  top )     look $     insert ')' (phrase-level)
  17  top Tp    look $     expand Tp -> epsilon
  18  top Ep    look $     expand Ep -> epsilon
  19  top $     look $     ACCEPT
  RESULT: 1 error(s), recovered to end of input:
    @4  inserted missing ')' before '$'

